  "description": "Designs, engineers, and validates enterprise Gemini platform architectures. Use when designing multi-project hierarchies (Host, Central Governance Hub, Runtime Spoke, Tool/MCP Spoke), configuring Agent Gateway, authoring Agent Connectivity Templates (ALL_TRAFFIC vs PRIVATE_RANGES_ONLY), deploying Secure Web Proxy (SWP) with Policy-Based Routing (PBR) or Cross-Cloud mTLS Egress Hubs, configuring Private CA TrustConfig with Internal ALB + Serverless NEG, implementing Unified Access Policies (UAP Policy V2 CEL) and Semantic Governance (SGP), configuring 3P IdP Token Exchange (EntraID/Ping/Okta via ext_proc + STS) or Agent Identity Auth Manager (SPIFFE), enforcing Model Armor Floor Settings and Fail-Closed guardrails, deploying Cross-Project Registry sync, binding ADK agents on Agent Runtime, or executing Day-2 lifecycle operations. Don't use for read-only live log triage or incident diagnosis, or generic Google Cloud Identity and Access Management (IAM) debugging.",
